 "remarks": "Lovely townhouse in a prime Glenbrook neighborhood close to transportation, restaurants, bars, shopping and conveniences. Glenbrook train station is 1/2 mile away, I95 1 mile away......so convenient! Inside you will find 2 spacious bedrooms on the second floor, lovely kitchen with newer appliances, access to sliders to a patio and side yard space, large dining and family room with beautiful new flooring and a bonus room in the lower level great for storage or another living space. Coin-op shared laundry in the lower level as well. 2 reserved parking spots round out this must-see rental.",
